{"prototypeToken":{"displayName":20,"displayBars":20,"flags":{"pf2e":{"linkToActorSize":true,"autoscale":true}},"height":1,"width":1,"name":"Vengewhisper","actorLink":false,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/tokens/vengewhisper.webp","scaleX":2,"scaleY":2,"tint":"#ffffff","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"light":{"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1},"negative":false,"priority":0},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":true,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":2,"texture":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/tokens/vengewhisper.webp"}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"depth":1},"name":"Vengewhisper","type":"npc","effects":[],"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":125,"temp":0,"max":125,"details":"negative healing"},"ac":{"value":28,"details":""},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":0,"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"fly","value":25}],"details":""},"resistances":[{"type":"all-damage","value":10,"exceptions":["force","ghost-touch","vitality"],"doubleVs":["non-magical"]}],"immunities":[{"type":"death-effects","exceptions":[]},{"type":"disease","exceptions":[]},{"type":"fear-effects","exceptions":[]},{"type":"paralyzed","exceptions":[]},{"type":"poison","exceptions":[]},{"type":"precision","exceptions":[]},{"type":"unconscious","exceptions":[]}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":["common"],"details":"one language spoken by the triggering victim"},"level":{"value":11},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>Vengewhispers are departed spirits that haunt a spellcaster after a corpse critically succeeds against <em>@Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.FM3SmEW8N1FCRjqt]{Talking Corpse}</em> or a similar effect. They might have died keeping a terrible secret, they might resent having their remains disturbed, or they might hold a specific vendetta against the spellcaster. Vengewhispers are also known to spawn after a cursed scroll of talking corpse is activated. A vengewhisper can defend itself when discovered, but most vengewhispers prefer to remain invisible to their victims and antagonize them throughout their search for knowledge. Nevertheless, occasionally a vengewhisper that's cornered, desperate, or particularly enraged chooses to engage in battle instead of subtler torments, and they can be particularly troublesome foes.</p>\n<h2>Guessing Games</h2>\n<p>Vengewhispers tell the truth when they assail a victim's curiosity and can accidentally hint at the answers the victim tried to get out of its corpse. Whether by embarrassment or magical compulsion, guessing those answers often dismisses the vengewhisper.</p>\n<h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2>\n<p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 175/390/720 gp</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> perception item, skill items (Intimidation, Lore [Life], Stealth)</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> chaotic, charisma, dexterity, energy resistant (acid, cold, electricity, fire, negative, sonic), evil, force, mental, sonic, spells (Occult: confusion, ghost sound, invisibility, mage hand, nightmare, phantom pain, telekinetic projectile), wild, winged</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Strange and Unusual","authors":"W. Brian Lane","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"creatureType":""},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":-4},"dex":{"mod":5},"con":{"mod":0},"int":{"mod":3},"wis":{"mod":5},"cha":{"mod":7}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":24,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":18,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":21,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":24,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"intimidation":{"base":26},"stealth":{"base":23}},"traits":{"value":["chaotic","evil","incorporeal","spirit","undead","unholy"],"rarity":"rare","size":{"value":"med"}}},"img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/Portraits/vengewhisper.webp","items":[{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Darkvision","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Darkvision]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"darkvision","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"type":"action","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"CIWVguTLismR00HG":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688940477402,"modifiedTime":1688940477402,"lastModifiedBy":"CIWVguTLismR00HG","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.qCCLZhnp2HhP3Ex6","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"fjTHkpdEgeF2beGl"},{"name":"Life Lore","type":"lore","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"mod":{"value":23},"proficient":{"value":0},"variants":{"0":{"label":"topics related to the creature's life","options":""}}},"effects":[],"_id":"bA0VlcttCc66jEwK","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/lore.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"CIWVguTLismR00HG":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688940734893,"modifiedTime":1688940767753,"lastModifiedBy":"CIWVguTLismR00HG","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Claim Victim","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The vengewhisper's corpse critically succeeds against <em>@Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.FM3SmEW8N1FCRjqt]{Talking Corpse}</em> or a similar effect to access its memories.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The vengewhisper manifests adjacent to the spellcaster, appearing from any distance, under the effects of <em>@Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.XXqE1eY3w3z6xJCB]{Invisibility}</em>. The vengewhisper designates the spellcaster as its victim. The spellcaster remains designated as the vengewhisper's victim until the vengewhisper is destroyed or the vengewhisper uses Claim Victim again.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"pePHhGjN5yuSGXvj","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"CIWVguTLismR00HG":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688940780239,"modifiedTime":1688941003679,"lastModifiedBy":"CIWVguTLismR00HG","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Assail Curiosity","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The vengewhisper's victim attempts to Recall Knowledge.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The vengewhisper surrounds its victim in whispers that speak terrifying truths. After resolving the effects of Recall Knowledge, the victim becomes @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Frightened]{Frightened 1}, or @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Frightened]{Frightened 2} if the victim received two or more pieces of information (true or otherwise) from Recalling Knowledge. The victim can't Recall Knowledge again while frightened in this way.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["auditory","emotion","mental"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"8Ooo44YJbTAIMAnV","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"CIWVguTLismR00HG":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688940782117,"modifiedTime":1688941118786,"lastModifiedBy":"CIWVguTLismR00HG","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Vengeance Surge","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The vengewhisper is affected by <em>@Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.XXqE1eY3w3z6xJCB]{Invisibility}</em>.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The vengewhisper Dismisses <em>invisibility</em>, Flies up to twice its fly Speed, and makes a melee Strike against a victim. The victim is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Off-Guard]{Off-Guard} against this Strike.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":2},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"7heo4wsXKpzRAciz","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"CIWVguTLismR00HG":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688940785648,"modifiedTime":1688941187569,"lastModifiedBy":"CIWVguTLismR00HG","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Victim Strike","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The vengewhisper hits its victim with a whisper hand Strike.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The victim becomes @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Frightened]{Frightened 1} (@Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Frightened]{Frightened 2} on a critical hit).</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["emotion","fear","mental"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"q0WygvgdqA2qjkk4","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"CIWVguTLismR00HG":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688940786463,"modifiedTime":1688941249569,"lastModifiedBy":"CIWVguTLismR00HG","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Haunt Victim","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Each day, the vengewhisper can choose one victim to haunt, in addition to any victim it maintains with its Claim Victim reaction. It must be observing a creature to choose that creature as its victim for the day. As long as the vengewhisper is within 60 feet of its victim and has line of effect, it takes the haunted victim twice as long to carry out exploration activities and they're @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Slowed]{Slowed 1} for their first turn after rolling initiative. If the haunted victim travels via a teleportation effect, the vengewhisper can choose to travel with them.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"PlanmiNfo3Q8jPkJ","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"CIWVguTLismR00HG":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688941366144,"modifiedTime":1688941421933,"lastModifiedBy":"CIWVguTLismR00HG","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Negative Healing","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.NegativeHealing]</p>"},"rules":[{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"override","path":"system.attributes.hp.negativeHealing","value":true}],"slug":"negative-healing","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}}